The previously verified local macOS 15.1 lab supplied the working launch/menu
ordering. This adaptation removes Sparkle, clipboard writes, auto-paste,
context-menu automation, scanning, and window-list inspection. It adds a
single-photo JSON result protocol, strict device selection, Chinese menu
titles, bounded ImageIO validation, and private local files.
